# Walkthrough: FreeYourHand

## What Was Built

**FreeYourHand** — 一個完整的 Mac 語音輸入潤稿工具，結合本地 Whisper 辨識與 Gemini AI 校對。

### Architecture

```mermaid
graph LR
    HK[HotkeyListener<br/>pynput] -->|key_pressed| P[Pipeline]
    P -->|start| AR[AudioRecorder<br/>pyaudio]
    AR -->|WAV file| WE[WhisperEngine<br/>mlx-whisper]
    WE -->|transcript| GC[GeminiClient<br/>google-genai]
    GC -->|polished text| CB[ClipboardManager<br/>pbcopy + osascript]
    AR -->|RMS signal| OW[OverlayWindow]
    P -->|state_changed| OW
    P -->|state_changed| TI[TrayIcon]
```

